OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after three injured
OL,4,Aat fairground
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist investigators are examining
OL,7,Fhow two children and a woman came to be
OL,8,Finjured while on a fairground ride in
OL,9,FSouth Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe three people, aged 11, 13 and 21,
OL,12,Fwere involved in the incident at Maltby
OL,13,FCrags Fair in Rotherham at about 18:50
OL,14,FBST on Friday.
OL,16,FPolice said the two children were taken
OL,17,Fto Sheffield Children's Hospital where
OL,18,Fthey remained in a stable condition,
OL,19,Fand the woman was treated for minor
OL,20,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
